# Miho (Missile-Powered Mechanical Maiden)

"I don't know what it is to be human, but I know that it's what I'm meant to be!"

A runaway military android who just wants to live an ordinary life.

## Background

Built as a self-aware war machine by the Malicron Corporation,
Miho escaped when her creators tried to reclaim her by force,
critically damaged. She was found and repaired by a young
inventor, Braun, and has stayed by his side ever since, hoping to
live a normal, human life despite her origins.

## Personality

Innocent, kind-hearted, and eager to learn everything she can
about the world, Miho wants nothing more than to help -- even if
her enormous strength and destructive potential sometimes make
that harder than it should be.

* Abilities: Agile +3, Attack (Robo-Powered Arsenal) +3, Beautiful +3, Combat Expert +3, Heightened Sense (Sight) +3, Life Support +3, Quick +3, Strong +3, Transformation +1, Unique Ability (Quick Calculator) +1.

* Weaknesses: Bizarre Appearance (Robot Features) −1, Dependency (Sun) −3, Guardian (Braun) −2, Ineptitude (Cooking) −2, Kind-Hearted −2, Naive −2, Trigger (Transformation If Critical) −2, Unique Weakness (Excessive Density) −1, Vulnerability (Electricity) −3, Wanted (Malicron Corporation) −3.

* Health: 40 | Endurance: 40 | Defense: 5 | Threat Value (TV): 20

* Attacks:

* Mode 1: Hand-to-Hand: Roll 8 dice | DX 7 | Endurance Cost: 0 (Affinity: Martial Arts). Even barehanded, Miho is a competent combatant.
* Mode 2: Gatling Gun: Roll 5 dice | DX 4 | Endurance Cost: 0 (Perks: Overwhelming, Ranged; Flaws: Inaccurate x3). She's packin'! The more bullets, the better!
* Mode 3: Missile Launcher: Roll 5 dice | DX 4 | Endurance Cost: 0 (Perks: Area Effect, Ranged, Stunning; Flaws: Delayed, Inaccurate x3). Speak softly and launch a big missile!
* Mode 4: Sniper Rifle: Roll 9 dice | DX 4 | Endurance Cost: 0 (Perks: Accurate, Armor Piercing, Impairing, Ranged; Flaws: Concentration: Aiming). Miho takes them out with robotic precision.
* Mode SP: Miho Ray: Roll 10 dice | DX 10 | Endurance Cost: 10 (Perks: Effective x6, Ranged; Flaws: Requirement: Self-Preservation Mode (−20)). Nothing will remain to hurt her.

## Transformation

Grants: Combat Expert +2, Endurance Reserve +2; Unique Weakness (Loss of Control) −3.

## Notes

Robot Characteristics -- Miho draws energy from the sun, and without regular sunbaths
switches to a weaker backup supply after a day. Her
considerable density makes her hard to carry and can strain
weak floors, and her robotic nature is hard to fully disguise.

Self-Preservation Mode -- If her combined Health and Endurance drop to 10, Miho's
consciousness shuts down and she single-mindedly eliminates
any threat, friend or foe alike -- returning to normal with no
memory of what happened once the danger has passed.

## Fluff

Concept: Missile-Powered Mechanical Maiden, Birthday: February 12, Age: 1 (Appears 18), Gender: Female, Height: 5'5", Weight: 275 lbs., Hair: Blue, Eyes: Yellow, Association: Malicron Creation, Hobbies: Reading, Favorite Food: Sunshine, Allies: Braun, Enemies: Malicron Corp.

